    <h2>Fantasy Baseball Draft Helper (In Progress)</h2>
    <p>This Python-based tool helps fantasy baseball players make more informed draft decisions using historical stats and machine learning models.</p>
    <ul>
        <li><p>Scrapes player statistics from FanGraphs and Baseball Savant.</p></li>
        <li><p>Ranks players by projected value across scoring categories using weighted calculations.</p></li>
        <li><p>Includes position scarcity logic and dynamic ranking updates as the draft progresses.</p></li>
        <li><p><strong>Technologies:</strong> Python, Pandas, Scikit-learn, BeautifulSoup.</p></li>
    </ul>
